<header class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow mb-3">LECTURE MATERIAL → PERSONAL STUDY NOTES</div><h1>Make your lecture notes easier to understand.</h1><p class="mt-3">Upload your lecturer’s original material or paste it below. The generator organises the key ideas into clear academic content notes, with examples, key terms and revision questions.</p><span class="pill">Word + PDF export</span> <span class="pill">No student account</span> <span class="pill">Source-based drafting</span></div></header>
