<div class="col-lg-5 form-panel"><div class="glass p-4"><h4 class="fw-bold mb-1">Your lecture material</h4><p class="muted small mb-4">The uploaded file is read in your browser. Its extracted text is sent to the AI service for processing.</p>
<form id="notesForm"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">Upload original notes (PDF, DOCX or TXT)</label><div class="drop"><div class="fs-2">⇧</div><div class="fw-bold">Choose your lecture file</div><input class="form-control mt-3" id="file" type="file" accept=".pdf,.docx,.txt"><small class="muted">Text-based PDF files work best. Scanned PDFs need OCR first.</small></div></div>
<div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">Or paste the lecture notes</label><textarea class="form-control" id="source" rows="8" placeholder="Paste the lecturer’s original notes here..."></textarea></div>
<div class="row g-3"><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Course / module</label><input class="form-control" id="course" placeholder="e.g. Research Methods"></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Topic / lecture title</label><input class="form-control" id="topic" placeholder="e.g. Research Design"></div><div class="col-6"><label class="form-label">Academic level</label><select class="form-select" id="level"><option>University undergraduate</option><option>Certificate</option><option>Diploma</option><option>Postgraduate</option></select></div><div class="col-6"><label class="form-label">Writing style</label><select class="form-select" id="voice"><option>Clear academic English</option><option>Simple and explanatory English</option><option>Formal academic English</option></select></div></div>
<div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">What should the notes emphasise? (optional)</label><textarea class="form-control" id="focus" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. Explain concepts with practical examples and clear definitions."></textarea></div>
<div class="form-check mt-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="confirm" required><label class="form-check-label small" for="confirm">I have permission to use this material and will review and personalise the generated notes.</label></div>
<button class="btn btn-wine w-100 mt-4" id="generate" type="submit">Generate my content notes →</button><div class="small muted mt-3">Your classmates may use the same source. The generator varies the organisation and explanatory approach, while preserving the source’s meaning. It cannot guarantee that every output will be unique.</div></form></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-7"><div class="glass p-3 p-md-4"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3 toolbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR GENERATED DOCUMENT</div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-0">Content notes preview</h4></div><div class="d-flex gap-2"><button class="btn-soft" id="word" disabled>Word</button><button class="btn-soft" id="pdf" disabled>PDF</button></div></div><div id="status" class="alert alert-light border small">Your structured notes will appear here after generation.</div><article id="result" class="result" aria-live="polite"><div class="text-center py-5 muted"><div class="display-5 mb-3">✎</div><h5>Ready when you are</h5><p class="mb-0">Add the original lecture notes to begin.</p></div></article></div></div></div></main>
